# the FM pages: a third press on an FM voice; the algorithm overridden, kept by the piece; a non-FM voice: greyed.
# (1.4.0) The chord's fourth press: its LFO page (Depth, Rate: 1 to 32 bars, Shape; Drift, the random walk); then back. The pings' and the
# bass's FM pages: their fourth knob none now (their LFO gone). (1.4.0, the user's) The Chord FM page for every voice,
# its fourth knob Colour (on a voice not FM the only one); ALGORITHM on the Chord LFO page its Destination (Cutoff,
# Reso, Colour), the big ring naming it, the moving knob on its page
listen
wait 3000
tap ENV
wait 200
turn ALGO 1
wait 300
said VOICE Keys
tap ENV
tap ENV
wait 400
said Chord FM page, voice Keys: Algo Voice, Ratio 0, Feedback 0, Colour 0
expect view 12
spin K1 1
wait 300
expect par52 1
said Algo 1
spin K3 40
wait 300
expect par54 40
wait 4000
expect peak_db_max -0.5
tap ENV
wait 400
expect view 22
said Chord LFO page, destination Cutoff: Depth 25, Rate 4 bars, Shape Sine, Drift 30
# ALGORITHM: the Destination, round (Cutoff, Reso, Colour), the voice left be
turn ALGO 1
wait 300
expect par134 1
said DESTINATION Reso
expect par22 1
shot lfo_dest.png
turn ALGO 1
wait 300
expect par134 2
said DESTINATION Colour
turn ALGO 1
wait 300
expect par134 0
said DESTINATION Cutoff
spin K2 1
wait 300
expect par127 3
said Rate 8 bars
spin K2 9
wait 300
expect par127 5
said Rate 32 bars
spin K2 -3
wait 300
expect par127 2
spin K1 10
wait 300
expect par55 35
said Depth 35
spin K3 1
wait 300
expect par129 1
said Shape Triangle
spin K4 5
wait 300
expect par131 35
said Drift 35
expect par55 35
expect par127 2
tap ENV
wait 300
expect view 1
turn ALGO -1
wait 300
said VOICE Saws
tap ENV
tap ENV
wait 300
expect view 12
# (Saws isn't FM: the page's knobs grey at 0, and turning them changes nothing; Keys' feedback, 40, kept; but Colour,
# every voice's, turns)
said Chord FM page, voice Saws, not FM: Colour 0
spin K3 -40
spin K1 3
wait 300
expect par54 40
expect par52 1
spin K4 22
wait 300
expect par37 20
said Colour +20
shot fm_off.png
spin K4 -20
wait 300
expect par37 0
tap ENV
tap ENV
wait 300
expect view 1
tap ARP
tap ARP
tap ARP
wait 300
expect view 13
spin K1 9
wait 3000
expect par56 9
expect peak_db_max -0.5
# (the pings' fourth knob none now: turned, nothing; ARP again: back to Pings)
spin K4 20
wait 300
expect par59 0
tap ARP
wait 300
expect view 2
# the chord's LFO works on every voice: on Saws (not FM) its page as on Keys
tap HOME
tap ENV
wait 300
expect par22 0
tap ENV
tap ENV
tap ENV
wait 300
expect view 22
spin K1 30
wait 300
expect par55 65
tap ENV
wait 300
expect view 1
tap ENV
tap ENV
wait 300
expect view 12
spin K1 3
wait 300
expect par52 1
